#: source/how-to/run_state_machines.rst:6
msgid "Run Scripted State Machines"
msgstr "运行脚本化状态机"

#: source/how-to/run_state_machines.rst:8
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab includes hand-written state-machine examples for inspecting an "
"environment's observations and action interface without training a policy. "
"The state transitions run in parallel across environments as Warp kernels, "
"which keeps the examples efficient at larger environment counts."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 提供手写状态机示例，无需训练策略，即可检查环境的观测和动作接口。状态转换以 Warp "
"核函数的形式在各环境中并行运行，因此环境数量较大时也能高效执行。"

#: source/how-to/run_state_machines.rst:13
msgid ""
"Run these commands from the Isaac Lab repository root. Use ``--num_envs`` to"
" change the number of parallel environments and ``--viz`` to select a "
"visualizer."
msgstr ""
"从 Isaac Lab 仓库根目录运行这些命令。通过 ``--num_envs`` 修改并行环境数量，通过 ``--viz`` 选择可视化器。"

#: source/how-to/run_state_machines.rst:18
msgid "Pick and lift a rigid cube"
msgstr "抓取并举起刚性立方体"

#: source/how-to/run_state_machines.rst:20
msgid ""
"This example approaches a cube, closes the gripper, and lifts the cube to "
"its goal pose:"
msgstr "本例接近立方体、闭合夹爪，并将立方体举到目标位姿："

#: source/how-to/run_state_machines.rst:29
msgid "Lift a deformable object"
msgstr "举起可变形物体"

#: source/how-to/run_state_machines.rst:31
msgid ""
"This example uses the Newton backend to grasp and lift a soft object. The "
"Newton visualizer opens by default:"
msgstr "本例使用 Newton 后端抓取并举起软物体，默认打开 Newton 可视化器："

#: source/how-to/run_state_machines.rst:40
msgid "Open a cabinet drawer"
msgstr "打开柜子抽屉"

#: source/how-to/run_state_machines.rst:42
msgid ""
"This example approaches the drawer handle, grasps it, pulls the drawer open,"
" and releases it:"
msgstr "本例接近抽屉把手、抓住把手、拉开抽屉，再松开把手："

#: source/how-to/run_state_machines.rst:50
msgid ""
"Each script defines its states, wait times, transition kernel, and action "
"loop in one file. Start with ``lift_cube_sm.py`` when adapting the pattern "
"to a new manipulation task."
msgstr ""
"每个脚本在一个文件中定义状态、等待时间、转换核函数和动作循环。要将此模式用于新的操作任务，可从 ``lift_cube_sm.py`` 开始。"
